ishima Taisha); the deity's rule over three \"isles\" — Ashigara, Suruga, Kamo; or land between clear streams that looked like three islands.","御殿場市":"When Tokugawa Ieyasu's body was moved from Kunōzan Tōshō-gū to Nikkō after his death in 1616, a temporary palace (goten) was built here to rest it. At the Meiji mergers the town first took the older name Mikuriya, out of deference to the other villages."}},"kyu":{"22101":{"t":211,"k":52423,"r":[["@bakufu",25288],["@hatamoto",11332],["Ojima Domain",8096],["@jisha",6782],["@other",925]]},"22103":{"t":121,"k":25168,"r":[["@hatamoto",12751],["@bakufu",9257],["Ojima Domain",1931],["@jisha",946],["@other",283]]},"22131":{"t":42,"k":10145,"r":[["Hamamatsu Domain",9110],["@jisha",1024],["@hatamoto",12]]},"22132":{"t":62,"k":17447,"r":[["Hamamatsu Domain",12122],["@hatamoto",3373],["@bakufu",1003],["@jisha",948],["@other",1]]},"22133":{"t":65,"k":20740,"r":[["Hamamatsu Domain",5680],["@hatamoto",5287],["Horie Domain",4716],["@bakufu",3411],["@other",1646]],"p":1},"22134":{"t":70,"k":15859,"r":[["Hamamatsu Domain",13505],["@bakufu",1321],["@jisha",702],["Horie Domain",328],["@other",3]]},"22135":{"t":76,"k":23941,"r":[["@hatamoto",17173],["Hamamatsu Domain",3251],["Shirakawa Domain",2150],["@jisha",761],["@other",606]]},"22136":{"t":49,"k":13013,"r":[["@hatamoto",8482],["Hamamatsu Domain",3565],["@bakufu",378],["Shirakawa Domain",293],["@other",295]]},"22137":{"t":94,"k":12377,"r":[["@bakufu",8972],["Kakegawa Domain",1531],["@hatamoto",1075],["@jisha",799]]},"22203":{"t":72,"k":23356,"r":[["Numazu Domain",9388],["@hatamoto",5587],["@bakufu",3572],["Tanaka Domain",2134],["@other",2675]]},"22205":{"t":6,"k":1705,"r":[["@bakufu",753],["@hatamoto",652],["@jisha",300]]},"22206":{"t":34,"k":12754,"r":[["@hatamoto",4097],["@bakufu",2699],["Odawara Domain",2139],["Oginoyamanaka Domain",1950],["@other",1869]]},"22207":{"t":64,"k":17629,"r":[["@hatamoto",14182],["@bakufu",1993],["@jisha",1363],["Numazu Domain",92]]},"22208":{"t":16,"k":3